{'symbol': 'ED', 'date': '2022-07-21 16:30:00', 'title': 'CON EDISON DECLARES COMMON STOCK DIVIDEND', 'text': "NEW YORK , JULY 21, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CONSOLIDATED EDISON, INC. (CON EDISON) (NYSE: ED) DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF 79 CENTS A SHARE ON ITS COMMON STOCK, PAYABLE SEPTEMBER 15, 2022 TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF AUGUST 17, 2022. CONSOLIDATED EDISON, INC. IS ONE OF THE NATION'S LARGEST INVESTOR-OWNED ENERGY-DELIVERY COMPANIES, WITH APPROXIMATELY $14 BILLION IN ANNUAL REVENUES AND $64 BILLION IN ASSETS."}